            <ArticleTitle>Prevention of complications associated with intravenous sedation and general anesthesia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>289-301</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An analysis of three time phases--induction, maintenance, and recovery from anesthesia--is presented to clarify specific risk situations and the treatment necessary to decrease morbidity and mortality in the dental office.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
